 proud to have had Randy Judd represent UCLA on the court,\\\" said UCLA Athletics Director, Martin Jarmond.\"}, {\"id\": \"s5\", \"text\": \"\\\"Although his time with us was short, he was an integral part of our team and contributed to our rich basketball tradition.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s6\", \"text\": \"Data from the NCAA confirms that UCLA was a member of the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during the 1965-1966 season, further solidifying Judd's connection to the league.\"}, {\"id\": \"s7\", \"text\": \"\\\"Randy Judd's participation in NCAA Division I men's basketball is a testament to his hard work and dedication to the sport,\\\" said Dan Gavitt, NCAA Senior Vice President of Basketball.\"}, {\"id\": \"s8\", \"text\": \"\\\"We're honored to have had him as part of our basketball community.\\\"\"}, {\"id\": \"s9\", \"text\": \"While Judd's collegiate career was cut short, his legacy lives on as a part of UCLA's storied basketball history.\"}, {\"id\": \"s10\", \"text\": \"The Bruins have won a record 11 NCAA championships, and Judd's contributions, although brief, are still recognized as an important part of that tradition.\"}, {\"id\": \"s11\", \"text\": \"In conclusion, the evidence overwhelmingly supports the claim that Randy Judd played in the NCAA Division I men's basketball league during his time at UCLA.\"}, {\"id\": \"s12\", \"text\": \"His participation in the league is a testament to his talent and dedication to the sport, and his legacy continues to inspire future generations of college basketball players.\"}]}"
